Z||000025||Cheever2||12-20-2000||09:23 PM||||I say put in a television.  If the car is running, that's great.  If the car is needing repairs, you can sit out in the garage for hours watching the game.  Just bang a wrench on something once in a while to keep the ol' lady convinced.<P>Here in TX I'm thinking of putting an air conditioner in the garage.<BR>||||reg||6
